---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Telehealth Psychiatry Maryland | Mind Menders | Matthew Mauro PMHNP-BC"
  description="Telehealth psychiatric appointments available throughout Maryland. Matthew Mauro, PMHNP-BC offers secure video visits for ADHD, anxiety, depression, and more. Same quality care from home."
  activeNav="telehealth"
>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>Telehealth</span></nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-white">Virtual Psychiatric Care</span>
    <h1>Telehealth Psychiatry Throughout Maryland</h1>
    <p>Expert psychiatric care delivered securely via video &mdash; same quality, same compassion, from wherever you are. Available to patients throughout Maryland.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col-narrow">
      <div style="text-align:center">
        <div style="background:var(--teal-light);border-radius:var(--radius-xl);padding:var(--sp-12);border:1px solid var(--border)">
          <div style="font-size:4rem;margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)">&#128241;</div>
          <h3 style="color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)">Telehealth Available</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">Statewide throughout Maryland</p>
          <div style="margin-top:var(--sp-6);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--sp-3)">
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#128241;</span> Smartphone, tablet, or computer</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#128274;</span> HIPAA-compliant platform</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#9989;</span> Insurance accepted</div>
            <div class="about-cred"><span class="about-cred-icon">&#128337;</span> Flexible scheduling</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Why Telehealth</span>
        <h2>Quality Psychiatric Care Without the Commute</h2>
        <p>Not everyone can easily get to an office. Whether you have a busy schedule, limited mobility, or simply live far from Towson &mdash; telehealth makes expert psychiatric care accessible wherever you are in Maryland.</p>
        <p>Telehealth appointments with Matthew Mauro offer the exact same thorough evaluation, personalized treatment planning, and medication management as in-person visits. The only difference is that you join from your home, office, or any private space with an internet connection.</p>
        <p>All telehealth visits are conducted through a secure, HIPAA-compliant video platform. No downloads required &mdash; it works directly in your browser.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Telehealth Appointment &#8594;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center"><span class="eyebrow">How It Works</span><h2>Getting Started with Telehealth</h2></div>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">1</div><h3>Schedule Online</h3><p>Call (443) 798-7707, email, or submit the contact form to request your telehealth appointment.</p></div>
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">2</div><h3>Complete Intake</h3><p>We will send new patient forms and a secure link to your appointment ahead of time.</p></div>
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">3</div><h3>Join Your Visit</h3><p>At your scheduled time, click the link on any device. No downloads needed &mdash; just a camera and private space.</p></div>
      <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">4</div><h3>Get Your Care Plan</h3><p>Matthew will evaluate, diagnose, and build your personalized treatment plan &mdash; all via secure video.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center"><span class="eyebrow">Services via Telehealth</span><h2>What We Can Treat Virtually</h2><p class="lead">Most conditions treated at our Towson office are also available via telehealth, including:</p></div>
    <div class="conditions-strip" style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto">
      <a href="/adhd" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> ADHD</a>
      <a href="/anxiety" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> Anxiety Disorders</a>
      <a href="/depression" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> Depression</a>
      <a href="/autism" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> Autism Spectrum</a>
      <a href="/ptsd-ocd" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> PTSD &amp; OCD</a>
      <a href="/bipolar" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> Bipolar Disorder</a>
      <a href="/services" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> Mood Disorders</a>
      <a href="/services" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> Medication Management</a>
      <a href="/services" class="condition-pill"><span class="condition-dot"></span> Medication Follow-Up</a>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--sp-8);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Note: Some conditions may require an initial in-person evaluation. We will advise you at the time of scheduling.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Start Your Telehealth Journey</h2>
    <p>Expert psychiatric care from anywhere in Maryland. New patients welcome.</p>
    <div class="cta-phone"><a href="tel:4437987707">(443) 798-7707</a></div>
    <div class="cta-actions"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Request Telehealth Appointment</a><a href="/faq" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg">Telehealth FAQ</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
